    "status": "draft",
    "componentVersion": "0.1.0",
    "summary": "FinCore's international phone-number field with label, country selector, number input and helper or error. Supports global numbers without hardcoding a default country or using IP geolocation and distinguishes editing text, normalised international values and validation status.",
    "maturity": "contract; framework-agnostic CSS + native HTML reference",
    "lastUpdated": "2026-10-28",
    "canonical": {
